That's a good question... Nymphs are neutral, so they should be able to
steal your vorpal blade without problems - but the Excalibur? Dev. Team?

>3. I find that the character classes in Nethack don't have much distinction
>between them... unless i'm missing something of course... could someone out
>there outline the character classes in Nethack? Thanx.
>
There is some distinction (too little IMHO). Mostly it is in the area of
initial stats, intrinsics and equipment (and these differences don't last
very long ;-) - but there are some unique 'class intrinsics' (like automatic
gem ID-ing for archeologists, or valkyries ability to throw Mjollnir) that
no other class can acquire. Plus there are class specific quests and quest
artifacts (and if the possibility of wishing for quest artifacts were closed,
we would have even more distinction ;-).

For a general outline of classes read the guidebook.

